{% comment %}
  Renders the raw SVG markup for a single icon from the shared vt-icon set.
  Purely visual: every <svg> is marked aria-hidden, so pair it with visible
  text or an accessible label on the element wrapping this render call.

  Accepts:
  - icon: {String} icon key (required). One of: arrow-left, arrow-right,
    close, leaf, carbon, cotton-plant, tree, zero-emissions, quality, drop,
    ecology.

  Usage:
  {% render 'icons', icon: block.settings.icon %}
{% endcomment %}

